WEBVTT

00:00:13.310 --> 00:00:17.590
I know this cold voice

00:00:17.590 --> 00:00:22.020
Taking my friend

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:26.800
Maybe a little afraid you'll run away

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:29.700
But right now...

00:00:30.690 --> 00:00:34.720
For this moment in time, I want to hold you tight

00:00:35.250 --> 00:00:39.580
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:39.580 --> 00:00:44.060
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:00:44.330 --> 00:00:48.470
I'll take off and break all the way

00:00:49.000 --> 00:00:53.420
For this moment in time, I just wanna be with you

00:00:53.420 --> 00:00:57.940
By your side, I'm dreaming of the days

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:02.250
When I finally look up at the promised sky

00:01:02.770 --> 00:01:06.750
I know I can change all the way

00:01:07.270 --> 00:01:11.830
For the moment...

00:01:11.830 --> 00:01:21.320
I just wanna hold you...

00:01:30.810 --> 00:01:35.820
"Something that Never Changes"

00:01:39.230 --> 00:01:40.930
Hello, Kugami residence.

00:01:41.010 --> 00:01:42.560
We're not home right now...

00:01:42.830 --> 00:01:45.790
so please leave a message after the beep.

00:01:50.810 --> 00:01:52.280
Kajika...

00:01:52.340 --> 00:01:54.780
I thought she'd be back soon.

00:01:55.130 --> 00:01:57.870
Maybe she's stuck in Hong Kong...

00:01:58.800 --> 00:02:01.410
[Excited chattering]

00:02:07.680 --> 00:02:10.130
Well, now what?

00:02:17.540 --> 00:02:19.130
Kajika's friend?

00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:21.830
You can have that one, I made copies.

00:02:21.830 --> 00:02:23.830
Cute girl, huh?

00:02:24.660 --> 00:02:26.470
That's my friend.

00:02:26.690 --> 00:02:28.470
Hm...

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:30.470
She definitely has Asian features.

00:02:31.700 --> 00:02:34.500
But it doesn't fit, somehow...

00:02:34.670 --> 00:02:37.770
imagining you at school, I mean.

00:02:38.600 --> 00:02:39.840
Why?

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:42.370
You go to school, too, don't you?

00:02:42.560 --> 00:02:44.500
You'd stick out way more than me.

00:02:45.720 --> 00:02:48.640
It's been in my notebook ever since...

00:02:51.830 --> 00:02:54.130
Seems like a perfect way to kill some time...

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:57.320
Yui!

00:02:57.320 --> 00:03:00.280
If you don't hurry and get up, you'll be late!

00:03:00.800 --> 00:03:02.280
Yui!

00:03:02.520 --> 00:03:05.230
Don't blow your lungs out this early in the morning.

00:03:05.230 --> 00:03:06.540
It's so annoying...

00:03:06.540 --> 00:03:09.540
Why don't you wake her up yourself, then, Kota?

00:03:09.540 --> 00:03:12.400
No way. Big sis is in a bad mood lately.

00:03:13.040 --> 00:03:15.090
Think she's hanging out with weirdos?

00:03:15.230 --> 00:03:16.330
Oh, my!

00:03:16.330 --> 00:03:18.480
Wh--who's in trouble?!

00:03:18.630 --> 00:03:20.140
She's not in trouble yet.

00:03:20.140 --> 00:03:21.940
She will be soon.

00:03:22.130 --> 00:03:24.760
Our little girl's grown up enough for trouble!

00:03:24.880 --> 00:03:26.920
What are you so happy about?

00:03:34.530 --> 00:03:37.460
Kajika's been gone for two months now...

00:03:37.970 --> 00:03:39.830
Never mind coming back...

00:03:39.870 --> 00:03:41.990
I haven't even gotten a single letter.

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:48.430
I guess she really must have...

00:03:48.470 --> 00:03:50.440
forgotten all about me...

00:03:50.520 --> 00:03:51.480
for sure.

00:03:53.320 --> 00:03:56.480
But back then Kajika was so very...

00:04:02.760 --> 00:04:04.600
Just an ordinary greeting!

00:04:04.680 --> 00:04:06.770
That's all it was... for sure.

00:04:07.460 --> 00:04:09.730
It must be an American thing...

00:04:10.210 --> 00:04:12.980
--Bye bye! Later!
--See ya tomorrow!

00:04:16.290 --> 00:04:17.690
I give up...

00:04:17.750 --> 00:04:19.480
I can't tell any of them apart.

00:04:20.530 --> 00:04:22.200
Maybe it's the uniforms...

00:04:22.390 --> 00:04:24.290
but they all look like this girl.

00:04:32.520 --> 00:04:35.250
My horoscope for today was totally good.

00:04:35.520 --> 00:04:37.640
Oh, how cool!

00:04:38.170 --> 00:04:39.010
Lucky...

00:04:39.100 --> 00:04:41.780
Oh, look, it's Yui and the girls...

00:04:41.900 --> 00:04:44.220
Looks like I've been caught in the act...

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:45.540
Friends of yours?

00:04:47.220 --> 00:04:49.330
These are my classmates...

00:04:49.600 --> 00:04:51.090
This is my boyfriend.

00:04:51.280 --> 00:04:52.580
He's gonna drive me home.

00:04:52.670 --> 00:04:53.470
Hey there.

00:04:53.560 --> 00:04:55.000
Boyfriend!?

00:04:55.170 --> 00:04:56.970
You can't tell anyone, it's a secret.

00:04:57.040 --> 00:05:01.490
In that case is it really a good idea to have him pick you up at school?

00:05:02.070 --> 00:05:04.780
I didn't ask him to come get me...

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:05.670
Huh?

00:05:05.770 --> 00:05:07.870
Anyway, you're probably not ready...

00:05:07.910 --> 00:05:10.250
to understand the workings of the male-female bond...

00:05:23.380 --> 00:05:25.070
Yui Yamate?

00:05:25.240 --> 00:05:26.470
Y--yes...

00:05:38.080 --> 00:05:39.240
What the...

00:05:39.300 --> 00:05:42.490
Ultra-gorgeous foreigner! What is he doing here?!

00:05:42.680 --> 00:05:44.130
<i>Nice to meet you.</i>

00:05:44.150 --> 00:05:46.090
<i>My name is Eugene De Volkan.</i>

00:05:46.710 --> 00:05:48.210
<i>I'm Kajika's fiancé.</i>

00:05:49.880 --> 00:05:52.940
Kajika's fee-an-say...?

00:05:52.940 --> 00:05:54.260
...fiancé!?

00:05:54.260 --> 00:05:55.520
<i>Yes.</i>

00:05:57.020 --> 00:06:01.030
If Kajika's fiancé knows who I am, then...

00:06:01.380 --> 00:06:03.370
that means Kajika...

00:06:03.960 --> 00:06:06.030
told him about me!?

00:06:08.130 --> 00:06:09.680
<i>I'll give you a lift home.</i>

00:06:13.930 --> 00:06:15.580
So cool...

00:06:22.820 --> 00:06:24.540
<i>It's you and Kajika.</i>

00:06:26.040 --> 00:06:29.320
This... this was taken when she came to my house!

00:06:29.790 --> 00:06:32.470
<i>Dis iz mai home!</i> <i>"Mai home."</i>

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:34.480
<i>Is this your house?</i>

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:38.260
Kajika only came over once, but...

00:06:38.300 --> 00:06:39.540
we went and picked her up...

00:06:40.120 --> 00:06:43.620
Eventually, it got dark, and she had to go home...

00:06:44.100 --> 00:06:47.150
but it was fun...

00:06:50.820 --> 00:06:52.360
Kajika...

00:06:52.420 --> 00:06:55.690
you haven't forgotten about me...

00:06:58.590 --> 00:07:01.110
<i>I wanna visit your house.</i>

00:07:01.780 --> 00:07:04.480
Wha-huh? <i>Slow... please...</i>

00:07:04.700 --> 00:07:07.810
<i>I... wanna... visit...</i>

00:07:08.280 --> 00:07:09.670
<i>your house.</i>

00:07:09.800 --> 00:07:11.680
Huh? ... My house!?

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:14.150
Lee-Leng!

00:07:14.640 --> 00:07:17.450
There's a message from Mustafa on the answering machine!

00:07:18.210 --> 00:07:19.630
From Eugene?

00:07:20.050 --> 00:07:22.350
He says he's visiting Japan right now...

00:07:22.580 --> 00:07:25.090
so if it's convenient he'd like to meet up.

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:26.800
He's in Japan?

00:07:27.070 --> 00:07:28.660
Yeah... he says he arrived this morning...

00:07:28.870 --> 00:07:30.990
and he's staying at the Emperor's Golden Screen Hotel.

00:07:31.460 --> 00:07:33.470
I'm going right now.

00:07:34.460 --> 00:07:35.390
Wait!

00:07:35.410 --> 00:07:36.320
Lee-Leng...

00:07:36.320 --> 00:07:40.130
...until you make sure he's there right now, first of all.

00:07:41.210 --> 00:07:43.940
Also, I'm going with you.

00:07:44.730 --> 00:07:46.040
Fine.

00:07:46.720 --> 00:07:47.960
But, Lee-Leng...

00:07:48.020 --> 00:07:50.800
when it comes to Mustafa, you're such a baby.

00:07:51.280 --> 00:07:53.190
He seems so cool at first...

00:07:53.190 --> 00:07:55.580
but this side of him is so cute.

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:02.010
I--I'll go check with the hotel!

00:08:12.650 --> 00:08:14.200
I'm home!

00:08:16.440 --> 00:08:19.660
<i>Oh, you must be her mother.</i>

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:23.810
[Looking around] <i>How beautiful.</i>

00:08:24.590 --> 00:08:25.680
Mom!

00:08:26.520 --> 00:08:33.420
[Trying for English] <i>Ohh, sankyuu!</i> 
Thank--you--for--taking--such--good--care--of--Yui.

00:08:33.460 --> 00:08:36.320
Mom, that was Japanese...

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:40.050
Besides, I just met Eugene for the first time today.

00:08:40.300 --> 00:08:43.010
You might not remember Kajika...

00:08:43.140 --> 00:08:45.680
she only came over once...

00:08:45.780 --> 00:08:47.050
and had to leave before long.

00:08:47.100 --> 00:08:50.400
Ah, the extremely pretty girl?

00:08:50.420 --> 00:08:52.240
How could I forget?

00:08:53.070 --> 00:08:56.450
Right! This is "extremely pretty Kajika's" fiancé!

00:08:57.310 --> 00:08:59.830
<i>Yes. Fiancé.</i>

00:09:02.470 --> 00:09:05.370
Oh! My, my... at any rate, come in, come in.

00:09:05.500 --> 00:09:07.110
You'll catch cold.

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:08.970
B--bath! Would you like a hot bath?

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:10.340
<i>Thank you, Ma'am.</i>

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:14.210
Mom...

00:09:21.010 --> 00:09:23.180
So this is a Japanese bath...

00:09:31.170 --> 00:09:35.060
Your father's yukata will be too short, but...

00:09:35.190 --> 00:09:36.900
it's only till his clothes are dry...

00:09:37.200 --> 00:09:39.010
Is Yuji out of the bathtub?

00:09:39.140 --> 00:09:41.630
Not yet, and it's not Yuji...

00:09:41.690 --> 00:09:43.530
it's <i>Eugene</i>, geez.

00:09:43.910 --> 00:09:47.740
[sigh] ...Foreign people's names are difficult.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:50.410
Here. Take this in.

00:09:50.530 --> 00:09:52.710
Show him how to wear the yukata.

00:09:52.770 --> 00:09:55.880
What!? No way! He's my friend's fiancé!

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:57.770
You take it in!

00:09:57.800 --> 00:09:59.660
Really? Is it alright?

00:09:59.660 --> 00:10:01.270
I'm home!

00:10:01.560 --> 00:10:03.570
What's going on? Is someone here?

00:10:03.890 --> 00:10:04.990
Ah--

00:10:05.010 --> 00:10:06.110
Huh?

00:10:10.350 --> 00:10:11.860
It's so quiet...

00:10:11.950 --> 00:10:13.030
Kota?

00:10:23.220 --> 00:10:24.880
<i>Yui... Ma'am...</i>

00:10:28.960 --> 00:10:30.770
<i>How do I look?</i>

00:10:33.990 --> 00:10:36.700
Yuji, do you like sushi?

00:10:36.880 --> 00:10:39.280
It's Eugene, already! Geez!

00:10:46.000 --> 00:10:48.000
What a mismatch.

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:55.550
He looks incredibly out of place.

00:10:55.550 --> 00:10:56.700
Yuji...

00:10:56.700 --> 00:10:58.770
I keep telling you, "Eugene!"

00:10:59.060 --> 00:11:02.970
I brought you some tea. Dinner will be just a little while longer...

00:11:03.700 --> 00:11:04.820
<i>Pardon?</i>

00:11:11.940 --> 00:11:14.090
Ah, I was so nervous...

00:11:14.130 --> 00:11:17.500
It's like there's a peacock in my room!

00:11:19.480 --> 00:11:21.780
Do you think I can take a picture?

00:11:21.820 --> 00:11:22.960
Wh--...

00:11:22.960 --> 00:11:25.750
Dummy! What are you thinking!

00:11:25.880 --> 00:11:29.100
But I've never seen someone so gorgeous in my life!

00:11:29.480 --> 00:11:32.700
Just look at him, then! Just look!

00:11:34.700 --> 00:11:36.400
Geez, who's there?

00:11:36.400 --> 00:11:38.110
At a busy time like this...

00:11:39.450 --> 00:11:40.630
Coming...

00:11:40.790 --> 00:11:42.010
Yui!

00:11:43.910 --> 00:11:45.070
Yui!

00:11:46.130 --> 00:11:47.760
Ka... jika?

00:11:48.560 --> 00:11:50.630
Remember me?

00:11:54.680 --> 00:11:57.100
How could I possibly forget?

00:11:57.790 --> 00:11:59.130
It's been a long time.

00:11:59.290 --> 00:12:01.910
When your foreign fiancé...

00:12:02.000 --> 00:12:04.310
knew who I was...

00:12:04.310 --> 00:12:06.050
it made me so very happy...

00:12:07.070 --> 00:12:09.570
So Mustafa did come here, then?

00:12:10.340 --> 00:12:11.720
Too late now.

00:12:12.260 --> 00:12:13.580
Is he upstairs?

00:12:13.710 --> 00:12:15.060
Ah--yes...

00:12:15.990 --> 00:12:18.600
Wasn't Mustafa her leopard's name?

00:12:19.200 --> 00:12:20.570
Oh, welcome!

00:12:20.630 --> 00:12:22.040
Thank you.

00:12:23.280 --> 00:12:25.500
Lovely as ever!

00:12:25.500 --> 00:12:27.450
So... so cute!

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:30.160
Miss Kajika!

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:35.540
Hi, I'm Kajika's bodyguard, Toranosuke Haga.

00:12:35.830 --> 00:12:37.400
Excuse me.

00:12:37.810 --> 00:12:39.720
I'm going too!

00:12:39.830 --> 00:12:41.370
He must be a friend, too.

00:12:41.370 --> 00:12:43.970
Sure... but a cute one!

00:12:44.590 --> 00:12:45.980
'Scuse me.

00:12:48.160 --> 00:12:51.980
The girl who barged in here a moment ago...

00:12:52.020 --> 00:12:54.900
I'm her guardian. My name is Lee-Leng Huang.

00:12:55.070 --> 00:12:56.340
May I come in?

00:12:56.630 --> 00:12:58.070
P--please...

00:12:58.130 --> 00:13:01.540
Miss Kajika, her fiancé, everyone's upstairs...

00:13:02.520 --> 00:13:03.870
Fiancé...

00:13:03.930 --> 00:13:06.730
Yes, the blond who looks like a model...

00:13:06.790 --> 00:13:08.050
A real stunner...

00:13:08.670 --> 00:13:12.020
No engagement has been settled yet.

00:13:12.650 --> 00:13:14.100
Excuse me.

00:13:14.640 --> 00:13:17.240
How did my big sis ever get involved with these people?

00:13:17.450 --> 00:13:21.000
It's like Obon and New Year's, all at once...

00:13:22.380 --> 00:13:23.350
Mustafa!

00:13:23.580 --> 00:13:24.600
Kajika?

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.190
I missed you.

00:13:27.430 --> 00:13:28.760
You surprised me.

00:13:28.970 --> 00:13:31.080
Coming to Yui's house out of the blue!

00:13:31.220 --> 00:13:32.950
It's been very amusing.

00:13:34.890 --> 00:13:37.580
They're both so gorgeous... it's like a movie!

00:13:37.810 --> 00:13:40.590
When I checked with his hotel...

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:45.370
they said that after Eugene checked in, he asked for directions to Ohfu Middle School.

00:13:45.750 --> 00:13:48.220
This wouldn't be it, by any chance?

00:13:48.430 --> 00:13:50.880
Ah, he met me at the front gate of the school.

00:13:51.170 --> 00:13:52.740
Since he has no common sense...

00:13:53.300 --> 00:13:55.280
he must've been a lot of trouble?

00:13:55.280 --> 00:13:56.870
No, not at all.

00:13:58.360 --> 00:14:00.500
Speak English, speak English.

00:14:00.570 --> 00:14:03.330
If I speak English, she won't understand.

00:14:03.800 --> 00:14:06.430
Well, what did you say to Yui?

00:14:06.510 --> 00:14:08.300
I'm not an interpreter.

00:14:08.620 --> 00:14:12.160
If you're going to wear a yukata, maybe you should pick up some Japanese.

00:14:18.530 --> 00:14:20.630
Those two are... on bad terms?

00:14:20.800 --> 00:14:24.010
Not at all... fighting every time they're together...

00:14:24.090 --> 00:14:25.980
means they're really close.

00:14:26.080 --> 00:14:26.890
--Really!

00:14:26.890 --> 00:14:28.590
--Really!
--Really...?

00:14:34.550 --> 00:14:35.760
Thank you, come again!

00:14:37.200 --> 00:14:40.920
Counting your father there will be five men...

00:14:41.780 --> 00:14:43.600
you think maybe this isn't enough?

00:14:43.600 --> 00:14:44.940
How 'bout pizza?

00:14:46.340 --> 00:14:48.580
Maybe there's something else?

00:14:48.800 --> 00:14:50.060
Excuse me one moment...

00:14:50.080 --> 00:14:51.300
Oh...

00:14:52.710 --> 00:14:54.100
Bingo.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:55.070
Um...

00:14:55.110 --> 00:14:57.800
My companions have been such a bother to you...

00:14:58.530 --> 00:15:00.670
at least let me repay you for your kindness.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:10.950
So, this is a Japanese kitchen...

00:15:11.390 --> 00:15:12.550
Well now.

00:15:12.550 --> 00:15:14.760
Excellent...

00:15:14.910 --> 00:15:16.530
What is Lee-Leng trying to do?

00:15:16.690 --> 00:15:23.080
A dish from Beijing? I remember hearing he learned it from the Huang family chef.

00:15:23.080 --> 00:15:24.630
So to bring down an enemy...

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:28.130
he starts by kissing up to the friend's mother.

00:15:28.860 --> 00:15:30.460
As usual...

00:15:30.500 --> 00:15:31.990
beating around the bush...

00:15:32.350 --> 00:15:33.380
Hmph.

00:15:34.400 --> 00:15:35.680
Enemy?

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:38.210
Toranosuke, I need you to go shopping.

00:15:38.290 --> 00:15:39.660
Y--yes, sir!

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:42.760
I'm so glad...

00:15:42.970 --> 00:15:44.560
you haven't changed, Yui.

00:15:44.940 --> 00:15:46.140
How've you been? Good?

00:15:46.160 --> 00:15:47.300
Yeah.

00:15:48.520 --> 00:15:50.180
I waited for a letter...

00:15:51.850 --> 00:15:53.220
I'm sorry.

00:15:53.870 --> 00:15:55.970
I was going to write you, but...

00:15:56.720 --> 00:15:58.400
I didn't know...

00:15:59.140 --> 00:16:00.300
what I should write.

00:16:00.720 --> 00:16:01.670
Huh?

00:16:01.740 --> 00:16:04.030
But that doesn't matter, anything is fine.

00:16:09.410 --> 00:16:11.610
After you left...

00:16:11.690 --> 00:16:16.550
<i>[NY Burnsworth Group to Buy KLC Airport]</i>
I found out that Burnsworth was incredibly rich...

00:16:19.320 --> 00:16:20.530
To be honest...

00:16:20.580 --> 00:16:24.230
when the letter didn't come, I thought it was hopeless.

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:27.600
Lee-Leng...

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:29.540
always threatened that...

00:16:29.690 --> 00:16:31.490
If I let the Burnsworth name get out...

00:16:31.860 --> 00:16:35.020
everyone would see my Dad behind me.

00:16:35.380 --> 00:16:36.790
He said from then on...

00:16:36.830 --> 00:16:39.640
I couldn't be seen as my own individual.

00:16:44.010 --> 00:16:46.300
I don't really get it.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:49.360
The feelings of people like that...

00:16:51.140 --> 00:16:53.790
are too much for someone who grew up on an empty island.

00:16:55.280 --> 00:16:56.680
What do you think, Yui?

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:01.370
Do you look at me differently now?

00:17:04.150 --> 00:17:06.240
A little, I guess.

00:17:10.800 --> 00:17:12.950
But if your world ever...

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.790
gets too alien...

00:17:14.980 --> 00:17:16.720
come back any time.

00:17:17.100 --> 00:17:19.040
--Really?
--But...

00:17:19.140 --> 00:17:23.520
when it comes to huge buildings in Manhattan and private jets and stuff...

00:17:23.520 --> 00:17:26.530
it still doesn't seem real... it just sounds like a movie.

00:17:29.970 --> 00:17:32.330
Kajika is just Kajika.

00:17:36.340 --> 00:17:37.650
Thank goodness...

00:17:38.420 --> 00:17:40.290
I was really worried.

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:42.020
About what?

00:17:42.020 --> 00:17:44.690
What I was going to do if you said...

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:47.700
we couldn't hang out or be friends anymore.

00:17:47.940 --> 00:17:49.020
Kajika...

00:17:50.330 --> 00:17:51.200
That's why...

00:17:51.570 --> 00:17:53.260
I didn't write you.

00:18:07.530 --> 00:18:08.980
Hey, Kajika...

00:18:09.050 --> 00:18:11.410
Someday, are you and Eugene going to...

00:18:11.920 --> 00:18:13.170
I mean...

00:18:13.460 --> 00:18:14.580
Get married?

00:18:14.980 --> 00:18:16.850
I don't know yet.

00:18:16.920 --> 00:18:18.960
But he's your fiancé, right?

00:18:19.250 --> 00:18:21.330
I like Eugene, but...

00:18:21.390 --> 00:18:24.170
there are still other people I have to meet.

00:18:24.660 --> 00:18:26.960
When I meet them, then I'll decide.

00:18:29.170 --> 00:18:31.270
It really is just like a movie.

00:18:40.080 --> 00:18:43.620
Amazing! What else can I do to help?

00:18:43.910 --> 00:18:46.330
There's no need. Just go wash your face.

00:18:48.490 --> 00:18:51.330
Looks like you want to hog all the credit...

00:18:51.420 --> 00:18:54.070
I don't like accepting help with my work.

00:18:54.390 --> 00:18:56.490
The guy who travels with an underling...

00:18:56.550 --> 00:18:58.430
is pretending he's a lone wolf?

00:18:58.490 --> 00:19:02.130
What do you know about the world outside your prodigal son/gigolo act?

00:19:02.670 --> 00:19:06.550
A tough-talker with no experience is always jealous... it's pathetic.

00:19:11.360 --> 00:19:13.910
I'll go wash my face!

00:19:17.260 --> 00:19:19.040
I'm ho-ome!

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:20.440
Hey, wait.

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:22.510
Do we have guests?

00:19:23.370 --> 00:19:24.520
Welcome home.

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:27.670
What are you doing? You're in your best clothes...

00:19:28.750 --> 00:19:30.510
Yui's friend is here...

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:32.210
Friend?

00:19:32.870 --> 00:19:35.350
I'm ho-- ...ome.

00:19:36.560 --> 00:19:37.890
Welcome home.

00:19:38.030 --> 00:19:39.400
Thanks for having us.

00:19:42.170 --> 00:19:44.270
Wh--... welcome...

00:19:45.070 --> 00:19:47.300
What's happened in our house?

00:19:48.790 --> 00:19:50.270
I'm starving!

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:52.230
Chow time!

00:19:58.220 --> 00:20:00.100
--Like this!
--Like this...

00:20:00.960 --> 00:20:03.760
Your Beijing dish was the best!

00:20:08.100 --> 00:20:10.170
You don't have a fiancé, Yui?

00:20:10.610 --> 00:20:11.790
No way...

00:20:11.790 --> 00:20:13.070
Forget fiancé...

00:20:13.150 --> 00:20:16.380
she's never even brought a boyfriend home.

00:20:16.510 --> 00:20:17.540
Kota!

00:20:18.000 --> 00:20:20.330
<i>Yui is a very charming girl.</i>

00:20:21.060 --> 00:20:23.130
He says you're charming.

00:20:26.640 --> 00:20:30.870
Even a regular little girl like ours gives her parents plenty of anxiety.

00:20:30.940 --> 00:20:33.940
I can't begin to guess how many worries your father must have, Kajika.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:35.400
Truly...

00:20:35.460 --> 00:20:39.090
I've been told to watch out that she doesn't fall in with bad company.

00:20:40.970 --> 00:20:44.090
What did the coward next to you just say?

00:20:44.410 --> 00:20:45.890
He--I mean...

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.240
I can hear you.

00:20:49.030 --> 00:20:50.280
I can't take any more...

00:20:52.500 --> 00:20:57.090
Fathers... aren't always good at telling their families how they feel.

00:20:58.170 --> 00:20:59.950
Kajika's father, too...

00:21:00.010 --> 00:21:04.530
He's a single father who wants his daughter to be happy.

00:21:04.590 --> 00:21:08.280
He wants you to understand the meaning behind his words...

00:21:08.880 --> 00:21:10.720
That's what a father wants...

00:21:11.230 --> 00:21:12.690
You've had too much to drink.

00:21:12.790 --> 00:21:16.490
[As if reciting a poem] 
<i>The flowers' full blooming
 lasts just a short time</i>

00:21:16.490 --> 00:21:19.420
At least that's what they say, all you young people.

00:21:19.930 --> 00:21:23.140
But if you even think about acting rashly...

00:21:23.590 --> 00:21:24.740
...please don't.

00:21:25.060 --> 00:21:26.170
Dad!

00:21:28.050 --> 00:21:30.180
Thank you, Mr. Yamate.

00:21:40.120 --> 00:21:42.190
I'm so full!

00:21:43.910 --> 00:21:46.020
Your parents are wonderful...

00:21:47.370 --> 00:21:50.890
No way, when they got all excited I was so embarrassed!

00:21:52.100 --> 00:21:55.800
This is the kind of warm household you grew up in...

00:21:56.510 --> 00:21:58.050
Kajika...

00:21:58.660 --> 00:22:00.890
Even though I'm a Burnsworth...

00:22:01.780 --> 00:22:03.380
from now on, whatever happens...

00:22:03.900 --> 00:22:07.550
will you be my friend the same as always?

00:22:07.550 --> 00:22:09.720
Of course!

00:22:11.590 --> 00:22:13.760
Big sis, I'm taking the picture!

00:22:18.000 --> 00:22:21.380
Lee-Leng, just a touch further back... there!

00:22:21.380 --> 00:22:24.560
Yuji, move forward, just a little... Good! Stop!

00:22:24.560 --> 00:22:27.810
Hey, it's not Yuji, it's "Euzene!"

00:22:27.810 --> 00:22:29.750
Be quiet, already...

00:22:34.530 --> 00:22:35.520
Holy cow!

00:22:35.710 --> 00:22:37.260
They shine without the flash!

00:22:37.320 --> 00:22:39.500
They're all in full bloom...

00:22:40.420 --> 00:22:42.490
Hey, does my hair look weird?

00:22:42.620 --> 00:22:44.600
It's fine. What about me?

00:22:44.600 --> 00:22:46.790
You're always pretty.

00:22:46.920 --> 00:22:48.960
Right, taking the picture!

00:23:01.780 --> 00:23:08.380
I can't stand feeling this distance,

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:16.210
So I'm starting to search for your heart.

00:23:16.700 --> 00:23:22.790
Because you were always at my side, protecting me.

00:23:23.450 --> 00:23:28.020
And I'm afraid of being alone.

00:23:30.240 --> 00:23:37.280
Though it's been a long time, everyone's just the same.

00:23:37.560 --> 00:23:44.720
Whether sleeping now, or crying, I want to see your smiling face.

00:23:44.720 --> 00:23:52.240
Because I will love you, with heart overflowing.

00:23:52.240 --> 00:23:59.330
Don't turn away, look at me. I believe in you.

00:23:59.910 --> 00:24:06.860
So, no one else knows our secret thoughts

00:24:07.250 --> 00:24:14.240
The blue sea of a strong and beautiful time.

00:24:14.590 --> 00:24:24.380
In those arms, in that embrace, I'm alive.
